1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:03,390
A bug is easy to capture; proving the fix is the hard part.

2
00:00:03,946 --> 00:00:09,321
ReplaySpec turns that clip into timestamped evidence, a regression check, and a Chromium verdict.

3
00:00:09,877 --> 00:00:16,360
Observations stay tied to their frames; expectations, model hypotheses, and uncertainty remain distinct.

4
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:22,694
Optional Meta Llama 4 vision helps review selected frames; a constrained browser check decides the verdict.

5
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:29,423
Two cart clicks should move quantity from one to three; the buggy run stops at two, and the fixed run reaches three.

6
00:00:29,979 --> 00:00:35,031
Three curated cases cover checkout validation, a cart race, and a blocked modal cancel.

7
00:00:35,587 --> 00:00:40,528
Runs stay within bundled demo routes and local file storage; checkout collects no payment.

8
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:45,332
ReplaySpec: browser evidence, connected to repeatable regression proof.
